      "z": 10,
      "top": "60%",
      "html": "      <h2>The bridge is the city's compass.</h2>\n      <p>Stari Most links the banks of the Neretva and anchors a historic quarter shaped by Ottoman, Mediterranean, and European layers.</p>\n      <dl class=\"facts\"><div><dt>1566</dt><dd>Original bridge completed</dd></div><div><dt>2005</dt><dd>Old Bridge Area inscribed by UNESCO</dd></div></dl>"
